      "q": "Where should the rewritten qualification appear?",
      "a": "In the thesis and in what the body paragraphs set out to prove. Q3 Row C requires sophistication to be 'part of the student's argument, not merely a phrase or reference' (Q1 the same; Q2 reads 'part of the argument'), so a qualification added in the conclusion is a phrase."
