  "effect": "The balance does argumentative work that the sentence never has to defend: by presenting exactly two options in exactly the same frame, it implies that these are the only two options. A reader who accepts the rhythm has accepted the field of choice. Naming the antithesis is worth nothing on its own; saying what the writer has quietly excluded by narrowing the field to two is the analysis.",
  "confusedWith": "juxtaposition",
